# Optional locally. Recommended for production SEO: use your real HTTPS origin.
# Never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for secrets.
# SITE_URL=https://your-real-domain.com

# Vercel provides VERCEL_ENV, VERCEL_URL and VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL.
# No database, authentication or payment credentials are needed in this phase.

# WhatsApp ordering: international number with country code, digits only.
# Use the business's confirmed number. Do not include +, spaces or separators.
# Confirmed defaults (2026-10-27): Maní 573213390551, Yopal 573112567920.
# Location-specific numbers optionally override only the matching location.
# Blank values use that location's default. Invalid nonblank overrides disable checkout
# for the affected location instead of redirecting to a different number.
# WHATSAPP_NUMBER is retired and ignored; remove legacy values from the environment.
# Set these in .env.local or Vercel, then redeploy after production changes.
# WHATSAPP_MANI_NUMBER=
# WHATSAPP_YOPAL_NUMBER=
